---
description: VizMLIR repository conventions
globs:
  - "src/**"
  - "wasm/src/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `CONTRIBUTING.md` for setup and validation. Keep the app browser-only, preserve the existing JavaScript/Rust/WASM boundaries, and synchronize `src/wasm/abi.js` when `wasm/src/abi.rs` changes. Run `npm run build` after code changes.
